  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**(First number - 1)² = Second number**\n\n1) 12 : 121 → 12 - 1 = 11 → 11² = 121\n\n2) 6 : 25 → 6 - 1 = 5 → 5² = 25\n\n**3) 9 : 100** → 9 - 1 = 8 → 82 = **64 ≠ 100**\n\n4) 8 : 49 → 8 - 1 = 7 → 72 = 49\n\nHence, **option 3 **is the odd one.",
